## Design System

### Spacing Scale
- Use consistent spacing: 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48, 64px
- Tailwind classes: `gap-1`, `gap-2`, `gap-3`, `gap-4`, `gap-6`, `gap-8`, `gap-12`, `gap-16`
- Mobile: Prefer smaller spacing (16px max between sections)
- Desktop: Can use larger spacing (24-32px between sections)

### Border Radius
- Cards: 8px (`rounded-lg`)
- Modals: 12px (`rounded-xl`)
- Buttons: 24px (`rounded-3xl`)
- Pills/Badges: Full rounded (`rounded-full`)

### Shadows
- sm: Subtle elevation (`shadow-sm`)
- md: Default cards (`shadow-md`)  
- lg: Modals and floating elements (`shadow-lg`)
- Use sparingly in monochrome mode

### Colors
- Use CSS variables from `app/globals.css`
- Primary actions: `bg-primary text-primary-foreground`
- Secondary actions: `bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground`
- Accent: `bg-accent text-accent-foreground`
- Muted text: `text-muted-foreground`
- **Always verify contrast** ≥4.5:1 for text

## Mobile-First Development

### Breakpoints
- Mobile: `< 640px` (default, no prefix)
- Tablet: `sm: 640px+`
- Desktop: `md: 768px+`, `lg: 1024px+`, `xl: 1280px+`

### Mobile Requirements
- Always test at 375px width (iPhone standard)
- Test at 320px width (iPhone SE)
- Touch targets minimum 44x44px
- Use responsive Tailwind classes (`flex-col sm:flex-row`)
- Test landscape orientation
- Handle safe areas on iOS (`safe-area-inset-bottom`)

### Responsive Patterns
```tsx
// Good: Mobile-first
className="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4"

// Bad: Desktop-first
className="flex flex-row gap-4 max-sm:flex-col max-sm:gap-2"
```

## Accessibility (WCAG AA)

### Interactive Elements
- All buttons have ARIA labels
- All images have alt text
- All form inputs have labels (visible or `aria-label`)
- Custom controls have proper ARIA roles

### Keyboard Navigation
- Tab order logical and predictable
- All interactive elements focusable
- Enter/Space activate buttons
- Escape closes modals/dialogs
- Arrow keys for lists/menus

### Focus Indicators
- Visible focus ring on all interactive elements
- Contrast ≥3:1 against background
- Use `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary`
- Never use `outline-none` without replacement

### Color Contrast
- Normal text: ≥4.5:1 contrast ratio
- Large text (18px+): ≥3:1 contrast ratio
- UI components: ≥3:1 contrast ratio
- Test in both light and dark modes

## Loading & Error States

### Loading States
- Show skeleton loaders for content
- Show spinners for actions
- Show progress bars for uploads
- Never show blank space while loading

### Error States
- Display error message clearly
- Provide specific, actionable error text
- Include retry button when applicable
- Log errors to console for debugging

### Success Feedback
- Toast notifications for actions
- Inline success messages for forms
- Visual checkmarks for completion
- Clear confirmation of state changes

## Component Standards

### Buttons
```tsx
// Primary action
<Button className="bg-primary text-primary-foreground">
  Submit
</Button>

// Secondary action  
<Button variant="outline">
  Cancel
</Button>

// Destructive action
<Button variant="destructive">
  Delete
</Button>
```

### Cards
```tsx
<div className="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-4 shadow-sm">
  {/* Card content */}
</div>
```

### Form Inputs
```tsx
<div className="space-y-2">
  <label htmlFor="email" className="text-sm font-medium">
    Email
  </label>
  <input
    id="email"
    type="email"
    className="w-full rounded-md border border-input px-3 py-2"
    aria-required="true"
    aria-invalid={hasError}
  />
  {hasError && (
    <p className="text-sm text-destructive" role="alert">
      {errorMessage}
    </p>
  )}
</div>
```

## Animation Guidelines

### Performance
- Use `transform` and `opacity` for animations (GPU-accelerated)
- Avoid animating `width`, `height`, `top`, `left` (CPU-intensive)
- Use `will-change` sparingly and remove after animation
- Test on low-end devices

### Duration
- Micro-interactions: 150-200ms
- UI transitions: 200-300ms  
- Page transitions: 300-500ms
- Never exceed 500ms for UI animations

### Easing
- Entrance: `ease-out` (fast start, slow end)
- Exit: `ease-in` (slow start, fast end)
- Movement: `ease-in-out` (smooth both ends)

### Framer Motion
```tsx
// Good: Simple, performant
<motion.div
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 10 }}
  animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
  transition={{ duration: 0.2, ease: "easeOut" }}
>
  {content}
</motion.div>

// Avoid: Complex, may lag
<motion.div
  animate={{
    scale: [1, 1.2, 1],
    rotate: [0, 360, 0],
    borderRadius: ["0%", "50%", "0%"]
  }}
  transition={{ repeat: Infinity }}
>
  {content}
</motion.div>
```

## Voice & Multimodal UI

### Voice Status Indicators
- Show clear "Listening..." indicator when recording
- Show "Processing..." during AI response
- Display partial transcripts as they arrive
- Show waveform or volume visualizer

### Visual Context Indicators
- Badge showing "Webcam active" with small thumbnail
- Badge showing "Screen share active" with preview
- Timestamp of last analysis
- Clear way to stop/pause capture

### Upload Feedback
- Progress bar during upload
- "Analyzing..." status after upload
- Summary card when analysis complete
- Error handling with retry option

## File Organization

Related components should be co-located:

```
src/components/chat/
├── ChatInterface.tsx (main component)
├── components/
│   ├── ChatHeader.tsx
│   ├── ChatMessages.tsx
│   ├── ChatInput.tsx
│   └── ChatActions.tsx
├── hooks/
│   ├── useChatState.ts
│   └── useChatMessages.ts
└── constants/
    └── chatConstants.ts
```

## Testing Checklist

Before marking UI/UX task complete:
- [ ] Tested on mobile (375px and 320px)
- [ ] Tested on tablet (768px)
- [ ] Tested on desktop (1440px)
- [ ] Keyboard navigation works
- [ ] Screen reader announces correctly
- [ ] Color contrast verified
- [ ] Loading states implemented
- [ ] Error states implemented
- [ ] Animations smooth (60fps)
- [ ] No console errors or warnings

## Common Patterns

### Conditional Rendering
```tsx
// Good: Clear, readable
{isLoading ? (
  <Skeleton />
) : error ? (
  <ErrorState error={error} onRetry={handleRetry} />
) : (
  <Content data={data} />
)}

// Bad: Hard to follow
{!isLoading && !error && data && <Content data={data} />}
```

### Responsive Layout
```tsx
// Good: Mobile-first
<div className="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
  <h2 className="text-xl font-semibold">Title</h2>
  <Button>Action</Button>
</div>
```

### Loading States
```tsx
// Good: Clear feedback
{isLoading ? (
  <div className="flex items-center gap-2">
    <Loader2 className="h-4 w-4 animate-spin" />
    <span>Loading messages...</span>
  </div>
) : (
  <MessageList messages={messages} />
)}
```

